Package: electrocpue
Title: Electrofishing Catch-Per-Unit-Effort Analyzer
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Travis", "Shepherd",
           email = "shepherd70@gmail.com",
           role  = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for analyzing multi-pass electrofishing data,
    including assumption-aware population estimation via Zippin and
    Carle-Strub depletion methods, effort standardization for raw
    and amp-based shocking, model-based zero-inflation handling,
    and regulator-ready report generation.
